==============================================================================================
PART 2.  The two binomial identities the closed form rests on, exactly.
==============================================================================================
   sum_{i<=r}(N-2i)  C(N,i) == (2r+1)C(2r,r)          r=1..119 : True
   sum_{i<=r}(N-2i)^3C(N,i) == (2r+1)(4r+1)C(2r,r)    r=1..119 : True
   sum_{i=0}^{N}[3v^4-1.5v^2+3/16]C(N,i) == 2^N*3(3N-1)(N-1)/16   r=1..59 : True
   24 w(i) == 3v^4+4v^3-(3/2)v^2-v+3/16  (v=i-N/2, u=r-i, N=2r+1) : True

